092 1041 "selection" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322092 1104 #edb/ref 17592186322094 13194139534951 true] [17592186322092 1110 #uuid "58899065-cf86-5331-a128-02b0f5cc0fe7" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322093 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322093 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534951 true] [17592186322093 1111 #uuid "2f671610-4a25-5741-9312-4b208402a02b" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322094 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322094 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534951 true] [17592186322094 1111 #uuid "82836f60-ac9e-592d-bdfd-d3a976b92dfe" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322095 1034 "I only" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322095 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534951 true] [17592186322095 1111 #uuid "7154723b-d115-5d6d-97fe-4f88b36d107c" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322096 1034 "III only" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322096 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534951 true] [17592186322096 1111 #uuid "9f8b9ceb-4d97-5c2e-a469-72cfe2b322c9" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322097 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322097 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534951 true] [17592186322097 1111 #uuid "352460e9-f907-5659-997b-eb743962e763" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322098 1017 #edb/ref 17592186322099 13194139534951 true] [17592186322098 1089 "q-79581" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322098 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534951 true] [17592186322098 1100 "Find the degree of the homogeneous function $f(x,y)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{3}-{x}^{3}}\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{x}{y}).$" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322098 1113 #uuid "43b3d904-b08a-5c5e-b242-5fe6d02d0e66" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322098 1145 "A function $f(x,y)$ is homogeneous of degree $n$ if it satisfies the property\n\n$$\nf(tx,ty)={t}^{n}f(x,y).\n$$\n\nSo first, we compute $h(tx,ty),$ and then we simplify by writing it as ${t}^{n}f(x,y)$ for some $n$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(tx,ty) & =\\frac{(tx)^{2}}{(ty)^{3}-(tx)^{3}}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{tx}{ty}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{t}^{2}{x}^{2}}{{t}^{3}{y}^{3}-{t}^{3}{x}^{3}}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{tx}{ty}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{t}^{2}{x}^{2}}{{t}^{3}({y}^{3}-{x}^{3})}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{tx}{ty}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{t}^{2}}{{t}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{3}-{x}^{3}}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{x}{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{t}\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{3}-{x}^{3}}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{x}{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{t}f(x,y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\nf(tx,ty)=\\frac{1}{t}\\cdot f(x,y)={t}^{-1}f(x,y)\n$$\n\nand so the degree of the homogeneous function $f(x,y)$ is $-1.$" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322100 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322101 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322102 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322103 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322104 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1041 "selection" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1104 #edb/ref 17592186322103 13194139534951 true] [17592186322099 1110 #uuid "a9104691-ae71-5384-b59b-3636f8409678" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322100 1034 "2" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322100 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534951 true] [17592186322100 1111 #uuid "4a914889-f972-56f6-93d7-8ec526ca79e0" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322101 1034 "1" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322101 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534951 true] [17592186322101 1111 #uuid "01685af9-2e2d-5100-a873-2d735afaeeb2" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322102 1034 "0" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534951 true] [17592186322102 1111 #uuid "823394d3-aa4b-55d5-91a8-670b37a3d0d7" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322103 1034 "-1" 13194139534951 true] [17592186322103 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534951 true] [17592186322103 1111 #uuid "26872bf7-67